[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11106.469, "timestamp": "03:05:06", "text": "等等，我回来了，好的，嗯，回到我最……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11109.99, "timestamp": "03:05:09", "text": "朋友，呃，我们算是朋友吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11113.83, "timestamp": "03:05:13", "text": "更要好的朋友，嗯，我见过很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11115.389, "timestamp": "03:05:15", "text": "你曾是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11126.309, "timestamp": "03:05:26", "text": "我不在场，无线电也一直保持沉默。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11129.63, "timestamp": "03:05:29", "text": "一切都……嗯，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11135.389, "timestamp": "03:05:35", "text": "嗯，而且我们也没法好好庆祝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11140.03, "timestamp": "03:05:40", "text": "我流媒体播放四周年纪念日"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11140.99, "timestamp": "03:05:40", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11144.67, "timestamp": "03:05:44", "text": "今年YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11149.19, "timestamp": "03:05:49", "text": "2024年，嗯，今年是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11156.11, "timestamp": "03:05:56", "text": "嗯，东南方向确实很艰难，我们当时……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11159.71, "timestamp": "03:05:59", "text": "就像很多起起伏伏和"}]